    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/1a76c7c32817275864a08954b216266d.avif?t=1749985839\" data-has-big width=800 height=421 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/dcc0d0a173fa8b8f63f6fc56af6b2ee9.poster.avif?t=1749985839\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/dcc0d0a173fa8b8f63f6fc56af6b2ee9.webm?t=1749985839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/dcc0d0a173fa8b8f63f6fc56af6b2ee9.mp4?t=1749985839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Welcome to Machine of the Wasteland</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Step into the chaos, seize your destiny, and become the King of all Machines!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machine of the Wasteland is a high-octane vehicular combat action game set in a brutal, post-apocalyptic world where survival hinges on your ability to outmaneuver and outgun your enemies. MOW offers a taste of the fast-paced, twin-stick shooter action, as you battle through open arenas with customizable combat vehicles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Top Down Vehicular Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in Machine of the Wasteland is simple to learn but challenging to master, requiring you to stay constantly on the move to survive.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Test your skills in action-packed battles against enemy vehicles and armored personnel.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/47fdbe31a70eaa886bb6f6d1e7e7a76e.poster.avif?t=1749985839\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/47fdbe31a70eaa886bb6f6d1e7e7a76e.webm?t=1749985839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/47fdbe31a70eaa886bb6f6d1e7e7a76e.mp4?t=1749985839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Open Battle Spaces</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate sprawling arenas designed for high-speed, tactical warfare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The paths may seem straightforward, but hidden secrets and surprises await the keen explorer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/792fe414331fa4263fa3f0344713c857.poster.avif?t=1749985839\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/792fe414331fa4263fa3f0344713c857.webm?t=1749985839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/792fe414331fa4263fa3f0344713c857.mp4?t=1749985839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenge Ruthless Faction Leaders and other Bosses</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take on powerful enemies leading dangerous factions across the wasteland.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experiment with Upgrades</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your combat vehicle\u2019s capabilities to match your strategy and crush your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/e37690f6420fa1cf89236830f3af9434.poster.avif?t=1749985839\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/e37690f6420fa1cf89236830f3af9434.webm?t=1749985839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/e37690f6420fa1cf89236830f3af9434.mp4?t=1749985839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rev up your engines. The Wasteland awaits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/1a76c7c32817275864a08954b216266d.avif?t=1749985839\" data-has-big width=800 height=421 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/dcc0d0a173fa8b8f63f6fc56af6b2ee9.poster.avif?t=1749985839\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/dcc0d0a173fa8b8f63f6fc56af6b2ee9.webm?t=1749985839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/dcc0d0a173fa8b8f63f6fc56af6b2ee9.mp4?t=1749985839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Welcome to Machine of the Wasteland</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Step into the chaos, seize your destiny, and become the King of all Machines!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machine of the Wasteland is a high-octane vehicular combat action game set in a brutal, post-apocalyptic world where survival hinges on your ability to outmaneuver and outgun your enemies. MOW offers a taste of the fast-paced, twin-stick shooter action, as you battle through open arenas with customizable combat vehicles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Top Down Vehicular Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in Machine of the Wasteland is simple to learn but challenging to master, requiring you to stay constantly on the move to survive.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Test your skills in action-packed battles against enemy vehicles and armored personnel.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video